Did you point to the hours timer in the first hole and type the hours part of
the time? So, for example, if it is now 10:30 in the morning then type 10.
If it is 3:45 in the afternoon then type 15 (12+3).

Did you point to the minutes timer in the second hole and type the minutes part of
the time?  For example, if it is 2:30 then type 30.

Try your best to get the time right but don't worry about being exact.

